WEBVTT

00:00:55.970 --> 00:01:00.470
Rena... What will happen to us if we die?

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:04.230
I don't know. But...

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.600
But?

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:10.310
When I thought I might die alone,
I was really scared.

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:13.070
But I don't feel that way anymore.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.400
Huh?

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:18.910
Because even if I die, you'll be by my side.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.740
Big sis...

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.170
Who is that?

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:30.040
I think she's me.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.920
Another me, born from Alecto.

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:37.260
So, you gave her your ring?

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:41.760
Yeah. I think that's what
allowed me to see you again.

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:44.600
I see. Thank you.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:52.190
It's not over yet. Kei, Tia,
and the others are still fighting.

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:56.400
Let's go, Yui.

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:58.410
Okay, big sis!

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:25.470
Mother... Father... Please, watch over us.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:23.360
There's no end to them...

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:25.570
--Become the flash which pierces emptiness,

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:28.360
--dwelling in the charging blade!

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:36.120
It's ready!

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.710
Ingrid! Kei!

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:40.210
It took you long enough!

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.420
Ingrid!

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:49.140
I don't know what you two
have been up to over there,

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.510
but why don't you let
your big sister see?

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:56.930
Noa... Here we come!

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:04.690
Heh!

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.650
Sara! Tia!

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:09.780
Kuzuryu!

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:29.880
Not bad.

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:38.100
We won't let you get away!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.310
Narukami!

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:50.700
Huh?

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.740
Don't get distracted now...

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:14.720
What do you think of that?!

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:16.720
Give us back our sister!

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:20.520
I'm surprised! You two are pretty good.

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:22.940
But it looks like both of you
have reached your limit.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:25.190
--I'll just take it slow now--
--I'll just take it slow now--

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.610
You!

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:29.530
Sara! Tia!

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:30.860
Noa!

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.920
Sara... Tia...

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.500
The orbis... Break it!

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:53.890
People's souls are being held in there.

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:59.850
We made Lux Ex Machina...

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:04.770
And if it's bringing calamity
to all those people...

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:10.270
...then we've got to destroy it.
That's why...

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:13.570
Bis Sister?!

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:14.780
Noa!

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.200
Sara...

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:17.870
What'll we do?

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.920
Protect those dear to you...

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:29.000
Tia...

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:32.970
We've got to take her place and destroy it.

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:34.090
Huh?

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:37.300
We'll break it and take back the
souls of all of those people

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:39.510
that are dear to Yui and Ingrid!

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:43.060
And we'll save our sister!

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:45.730
Okay!

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:59.030
Sankojin!

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:07.000
The shield!

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:26.850
I-It's no good!

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:28.520
We were so close!

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.570
Sara! Tia! Move over!

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:40.160
Inferno Skewer!

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:08.690
This is it, big sister.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:31.960
Sara... Tia... Thank you.

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:33.340
--Big sister!
--Big sister!

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:41.930
Yui!

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:56.820
Big sister...

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:00.490
What is it?!

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:02.410
Whoa! The bottom is falling out!

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:03.780
Sara! Jump!

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:04.580
Big sister!

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:06.410
It's okay, I'll make it!

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:18.090
Controller of the quanta,
knowing the dawn of creation...

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:21.590
Pass through the infinite
halls and be present.

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:25.140
Relics of wisdom,
knowing the light of origin...

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:28.560
Come forth from the heavenly
void and reveal yourself.

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.450
Oful Mazdo.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:49.830
Johann...

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.660
He's grown quite a bit.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.880
Johann... What have you...?

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:55.330
Are you wondering who this is?

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:57.040
You should speak more respectfully,

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:59.880
considering the havoc you've
wreaked in this country.

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:04.590
I am Johann. The true king of
Lux Ex Machina.

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:06.260
What in the...?

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:10.180
I went to all the trouble of
capturing everyone on this planet.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:12.810
And you had to let them all go.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:17.820
What do you think you're doing?

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:22.150
You're in the presence of a king.
You must bow down.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:48.510
--How's that?
--How's that?

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:51.350
This is bad...

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:53.810
Ingrid, we've got to deal with Johann first!

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:03.530
I told you!

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:05.610
You can't do it.

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:20.920
Ingrid!

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:22.130
Kei!

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:32.560
Big sister!

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.270
That's it!

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:54.580
Sara... Tia...

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:55.790
Tia...

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.880
See you later. Bye bye.

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:19.100
Huh?

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:42.960
Yui!

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:50.840
Everyone...

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:52.180
Yui! You're okay!

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:53.100
Yui!

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:54.350
And Rena's safe, too!

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:55.850
Rena!

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.980
We made it, somehow...

00:14:58.180 --> 00:15:01.060
Oh, you're still here?

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:05.770
Well then, let me welcome you
once again to Lux Ex Machina...

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:11.570
Yuinshiel Asteria,
Empress of Enastoria.

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:14.160
Lux Ex Machina...

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:18.870
Yes! And it is I, the king, who governs
the divine relic Lux Ex Machina.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:31.920
And though we may both be rulers,
as you can see, I stand above you.

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:36.180
You may be right.

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:39.810
But I have come to make you
return the people I care about.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:44.520
I come as the Empress of Enastoria
and as a human being.

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:49.740
Well, you've taken quite a beating to get here,

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:52.700
but I'm afraid they've already been freed.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:55.030
So sad to see all your effort go to waste.

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:56.240
Wait!

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:59.950
You're just going to do it all over again!

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:04.660
That's right. After I eliminate all of you,
I'll start again. And I'll take my time.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:05.960
That's why--

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:07.590
What?!

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:16.260
That's why I won't let you do this again.
I'm going to stop you, here and now.

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:25.900
You think a measly human can stop me?

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:30.820
Yui!

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:32.030
Rena!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.210
What in the world...?

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:51.420
Rena!

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:54.170
Why...

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:55.380
Big sis!

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:03.770
She's...

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:05.190
--Okay.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:15.780
What is with her...?

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:19.570
Foolish human!
Why do you not bow before me?

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:28.120
Don't you understand?!
lam a far more powerful ruler than you!

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:36.300
Yes. Far more powerful...

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:42.510
It's true, Yui is not as powerful as you or I.

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:46.390
But Yui doesn't need that kind of power.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:51.100
Yui cares about other people.
That's why everyone wants to help her.

00:17:57.030 --> 00:18:01.530
That is the power of humans.
That is Yui's power!

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:06.240
Our power is nothing compared
to that... That is true power!

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.210
Die!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:32.570
What are you boasting about?
You can't do anything by yourself!

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:39.910
You can't do anything unless
someone helps you!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:44.610
But I can! I can do whatever I want!
I don't need anything like that!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.330
My power is true power!

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:54.130
You're going to end up as dolls,
so you might as well surrender!

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:01.260
Johann, are you jealous of humans?

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:02.680
What?!

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:07.390
When everyone forgot about me,
I felt really lonely.

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:11.400
I had no idea being alone would be so scary.

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:15.110
Be quiet...

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:17.740
You feel the same way, don't you?

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:20.150
I told you to be quiet!

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:26.200
I've got to collect all my dolls again!
I don't have time for this!

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:30.620
Hurry up and die, Empress!

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:39.920
I think you just want
someone to care about...

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:45.680
But we cannot accept your actions!

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:50.980
Rena!

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:52.390
Leave it to me!

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:01.320
I'm going to blow you away!

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.200
No!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:04.410
Yui!

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:18.090
Astral Blow!

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:42.650
Yui! Are you okay?

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:43.570
Rena!

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:46.200
Yui! Rena!

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:50.290
I can't stand you, Empress.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:01.050
I don't have any friends.

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:04.340
There's no one that I care about.

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:10.220
The human souls I collected ended
up being nothing more than dolls.

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:20.150
Yui... Rena...

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:24.400
Sara... Tia...

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:27.360
Yui...

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:35.120
For you to tell me that...
You, who has everything... I can't stand it.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:41.130
I don't care anymore.
I don't need anything.

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:43.170
I don't care about humans!

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:48.510
Yuinshiel Asteria.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:52.560
I will kill you.
